Subject: [PATCH] fix: prevent removeChild DOM error in markdown rendering

- Add MarkdownErrorBoundary component using react-error-boundary
- Disable rehypeRaw plugin during streaming to avoid DOM conflicts
- Use useDeferredValue to defer rendering during rapid content updates
- Add try-catch around removeChild in modal-manage for safety

Fixes: NotFoundError on removeChild during chat streaming

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
